		<title>Claude Haiku 5.5 arrives with massive price cuts proving the AI pricing arms race is far from over</title>
		<link>https://the-decoder.com/claude-haiku-5-5-arrives-with-massive-price-cuts-proving-the-ai-pricing-arms-race-is-far-from-over/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/claude-haiku-5-5-arrives-with-massive-price-cuts-proving-the-ai-pricing-arms-race-is-far-from-over/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Matthias Bastian]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 10:30:23 +0000</pubDate>
