		<title>Anthropic gives more security teams access to Claude with fewer safety restrictions</title>
		<link>https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-gives-more-security-teams-access-to-claude-with-fewer-safety-restrictions/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-gives-more-security-teams-access-to-claude-with-fewer-safety-restrictions/#respond</comments>
		
